      "parity": "match",
      "notes": "lots -> min(|finite(lots)|, 1_000_000); a size in (0, 0.00001) becomes 0.00001; 0 (unknown size) stays 0; non-finite -> 0. Path trades[i] is input.trades[i] after sanitizing."
